From a321bbf01f6f26b1d46965b2037abcd024bfff57 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: phlink <dev@phlink.local>
Date: Thu, 30 Apr 2026 00:17:14 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] phlink: phase 10.02c MetadataFetcher (TUF metadata over
 SimpleURLLoader)

Adds phlink::updater::MetadataFetcher: a per-check object that fetches
TUF metadata files (timestamp.json, snapshot.json, targets.json) over
network::SimpleURLLoader and feeds each body into TufClient::Ingest*.
Failures (network or schema) are surfaced as TufError via the result
callback.

Also extracts the metadata fixture builders from metadata_client_unittest
into a shared metadata_test_helpers source set so the new fetcher tests
can reuse them. Switches the phlink_updater_unittests test runner from
//base/test:run_all_unittests to //mojo/core/test:run_all_unittests so
that SimpleURLLoader's Mojo plumbing is available to the fetcher tests.

Tests (14/14 pass):
  - 3 new MetadataFetcherTest cases (happy path, network error,
    malformed JSON on timestamp).
  - All existing UpdaterService, UpdateCheckScheduler, and TufClient
    tests still pass.

Refs phlink phase 10-02c.
